{"data": [{"author_id": "2037574730136367104", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:44:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118701004581642259"], "id": "2118701004581642259", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1469011176080220162", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118663226129055948", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@onlinebl00dy THANK GOD THEY FUCKED OVER BREAK AND REM MY DOT IS STILL LIVING😭😭😭🙏", "url": "https://x.com/5872_constance/status/2118701004581642259"}, {"author_id": "2482408872", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:38:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118699591302619310"], "id": "2118699591302619310", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 70, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "The US 🇺🇸 has:\n\n- Claude Duet\n- Claude Finance\n- Grok Bot integrations\n- ChatGPT Dots\n- Siri AI\n- Gemini in Chrome\n\nEurope has??", "url": "https://x.com/Jtyles/status/2118699591302619310"}, {"author_id": "2118298138532618240", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:34:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118698470227706054"], "id": "2118698470227706054", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot. Claude Duet. OpenAI Dots. Meta Muse.\n\nthere's an Apache 2.0 repo that copies that \"AI coworker\" shape onto your laptop 👀\nnamed agents. memory. routines. your yes before they act.\n\ni opened the readme + this week's releases. people keep scrolling past this 🔥", "url": "https://x.com/FirstInFeed/status/2118698470227706054"}, {"author_id": "3138119558", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:33:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118698296814313600"], "id": "2118698296814313600", "in_reply_to_user_id": "774512", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118601700697391385", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@juberti I think you could add a touch more of realism by having my dot start cussing out a driver who didn’t use his directional signals to switch lanes before he says hello to me on the phone, or completing his coffee order in the middle of a morning briefing?", "url": "https://x.com/TheLadySource/status/2118698296814313600"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118697875777417216"]}, "author_id": "2115653046336176128", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:32:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118697986679296179"], "id": "2118697986679296179", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This week in AI, for busy people:\n1) ChatGPT \"dots\" go default Nov 18 — admins decide now\n2) Gemini Enterprise: live Salesforce (writes are opt-in)\n3) Claude: inference hooks GA for DLP\nIgnore: GPT-6 Cyber (cool demo, not your Monday stack) https://t.co/MFArltNEr0", "url": "https://x.com/aiforexec/status/2118697986679296179"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118697246913134592"]}, "author_id": "2115657430030045184", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:31:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118697868882239898"], "id": "2118697868882239898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "It is time to move on from Miles (my dot with Open AI). Incredibly intuitive. Generous usage. Unreliable and inconsistent local and cloud access.  Anyone else?\n#groklifechoseme https://t.co/gBAvi6nc7M", "url": "https://x.com/JGFFreight/status/2118697868882239898"}, {"author_id": "2089898160831250432", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:18:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118694425484505254"], "id": "2118694425484505254", "in_reply_to_user_id": "270137557", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118537421700673910", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@johnhelmuth_ I use my dot constantly for development. And when I'm away I text to continue work.", "url": "https://x.com/chemcrashed/status/2118694425484505254"}, {"author_id": "1823757488497336321", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:15:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118693741145809166"], "id": "2118693741145809166", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2052434492263178240", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118411960337289583", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Muse In the US, you’ve got ChatGPT Dots, Claude Duet, Muse AI, and Gemini Spark. Meanwhile, in the fucking EU, we’ve got bottle caps that stay attached so they don’t fall off...", "url": "https://x.com/sandor_bal6746/status/2118693741145809166"}, {"author_id": "1823757488497336321", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:12:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118693064831115277"], "id": "2118693064831115277", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "In the US, you’ve got ChatGPT Dots, Claude Duet, Muse AI, and Gemini Spark. Meanwhile, in the fucking EU, we’ve got bottle caps that stay attached so they don’t fall off...🤬🤬🤬", "url": "https://x.com/sandor_bal6746/status/2118693064831115277"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2118690473002807296"]}, "author_id": "1281312041580605440", "created_at": "2026-11-06T13:03:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118690788011909233"], "id": "2118690788011909233", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 102, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "MEGA TRACTION 😍 \n\n195008 glides